Protocol Goedel.Anything AnythingProtocol AnythingProtocol
	
	Section 3 "Profile and account registration"

	Structure ProfileAnything
		External ProfileService
		Description 
			|Describes a anything service provider


	Structure CatalogedIdentity
		External CatalogedEntry
		TStruct Identity Identities
			Multiple
		Binary Certificates
			Multiple

	Structure Identity
		Abstract
		String Name
	
	Structure DnsIdentity
		Inherits Identity

	Structure LocalIdentity
		Inherits Identity

	Structure CallsignIdentity
		Inherits Identity



	Structure CatalogedThing
		External CatalogedEntry

		String DnsPrefix
		String InternalIp 
			Multiple
		String ExternalIp 
			Multiple



	Structure CatalogedAnything
		External CatalogedEntry
		String Key
		Struct Enveloped<ConnectionStripped> EnvelopedConnectionAddress
			Description
				|The connection allowing control of the registry.
		Struct Enveloped<ProfileAnything> EnvelopedProfileCarnet
			Description
				|The Mesh profile
		Struct Enveloped<ActivationCommon> EnvelopedActivationCommon
			Description
				|The activation data for the registry.


	Section 2 "Carnet service"

	Description 
		|Anything device naming and provisioning

    Using Goedel.Cryptography.Jose
    Using Goedel.Cryptography.Dare

	Section 3 "Shared Classes"
    Service CarnetService "_anything._tcp" "anything" AnythingRequest AnythingResponse
		Description


	Message AnythingRequest
		External Goedel.Protocol.Request
		Description
			|Base class for all requests made to a registrar


	Message AnythingResponse
		External Goedel.Protocol.Response		
		Description
			|Base class for all response messages. Contains only the
			|status code and status description fields.
